            <div xml:id="m-dca26dcd-023a-4314-bc82-10a502122b35">
              <lg xml:id="m-ce5ce9ff-7109-48df-8b8c-10d82c132117">
                <l xml:id="m-f9f0bd03-6a37-4be7-8225-87f1c9da1735" facs="#m-563ca0c0-92ea-493a-a9b3-9c14947a24f8" label="text-like">and Sunday after the Epiphany.</l><l xml:id="m-f2c860f4-260a-4723-b18b-1b2a3c3e2bf7" facs="#m-9dc49cf0-c3b3-441b-af2f-3591a6028425" label="ambiguous">485</l><l xml:id="m-475820d0-3172-48c6-a6dd-f03868b849a7" facs="#m-9aee4304-fa1b-4548-9e7d-73e4a6c419eb" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-95eb1043-7f81-4305-9a96-b0b53f8058c9" facs="#m-e475f451-0c02-480a-a278-460e7333093f" label="lyrics-like">Mnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui l cleménter exáudi;“ et pacem tuam</l><l xml:id="m-c8dc20a5-d44e-4bbc-95ec-12f2bc6ffac8" facs="#m-81f8b3e3-cc8b-465e-8eb2-62b638d98328" label="lyrics-like">U caeléstia simul et terréna mo¬</l><l xml:id="m-06103fca-d8d2-418b-84a8-aa8dc1c9ab87" facs="#m-f78be649-401b-4914-a603-9fdb52c64681" label="lyrics-like">nostris concéde tempóribus. Per</l><l xml:id="m-2a2d24b7-7def-4e10-b3ee-0f8dbed4277c" facs="#m-5bc57505-99af-48c5-9bca-558d2f102e54" label="lyrics-like">deráris: t supplicatiónes pópuli tui! Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-88dcd5a7-7a5e-43c4-a985-5f7751ea84d7" facs="#m-0f81bbc3-d1cf-4387-91ee-25649fddc660" label="lyrics-like">Second Collect of Our Lady. Deus qui salútis. p. 41l. Third Collect for</l><l xml:id="m-7c1d176e-4f3d-4bc9-8b3a-744c977a7427" facs="#m-9bf5d96b-b1ba-483c-86fb-db892a68206a" label="text-like">the Church or for the Pope, p. 819.</l><l xml:id="m-5164297b-3252-4e58-9975-9621680c0d22" facs="#m-70b2ccb8-d797-4667-acac-bab2e69c8cda" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Romanos. 12. b.</l><l xml:id="m-9107f166-cdeb-48a1-9b2b-6ce47a7c68f0" facs="#m-117c6c58-f14c-4ff0-ac30-316c42fa8519" label="lyrics-like">LYRatres: Habéntes donatiónes ¡ Sollicitúdine non pigri : Spiritu fer¬</l><l xml:id="m-692bf13b-aa07-4c1b-bb6b-a71bdc78b755" facs="#m-581ac410-a3fa-4ee2-a04f-da25defcd491" label="lyrics-like">F secúndum grátiam, quae data</l><l xml:id="m-54cca58c-ac38-413b-bfd5-41fc28644653" facs="#m-b4741e1c-92bc-46a1-91a2-35d054f422b9" label="lyrics-like">véntes: Dómino serviéntes: Spe</l><l xml:id="m-a1f3f941-a9ef-4e43-a971-93d730837279" facs="#m-80b1f2dc-7aac-4f7b-8025-922beeb4c26b" label="lyrics-like">est nobis, differéntes: sive prophe¬</l><l xml:id="m-736effd0-0f92-4a3c-8aaa-c733b82788d8" facs="#m-2509a0d2-a61a-49b3-8cea-fa9b892c05dd" label="lyrics-like">gaudéntes : In tribulatiône patién¬</l><l xml:id="m-ee947de9-43a3-452f-bf35-00a6cf5caa23" facs="#m-1c784929-1334-4264-8583-0c65b8c02b93" label="lyrics-like">tiam secúndum ratiónem fidei, sive</l><l xml:id="m-3193e069-12e5-413c-80be-d961be6d8518" facs="#m-acda1ca6-bedf-422b-8093-7ec512efbb41" label="lyrics-like">tes: Oratióni instántes: Necessitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-de0429c8-4290-4811-8cfb-fe94e51c82bd" facs="#m-7ad8f3cf-a10a-417a-b2ad-0022d3a48d07" label="lyrics-like">ministérium in ministrándo, sive</l><l xml:id="m-65a5250d-2109-4e53-80a4-4eb560e2625b" facs="#m-41dd6ae3-50a8-4250-8811-0211596a2e57" label="lyrics-like">tibus sanctórum communicántes:</l><l xml:id="m-c1708b1d-5d95-41dc-9b78-133f44eba25a" facs="#m-d3d35c8e-345f-4437-8f76-da935dea931c" label="lyrics-like">qui docet in doctrina, qui exhortá¬</l><l xml:id="m-46b375a1-3a45-46a5-9c22-2143caaeaacb" facs="#m-8029cf5a-2fca-430b-b73d-4364151c534f" label="lyrics-like">Hospitalitátem sectántes. Benedi¬</l><l xml:id="m-2d3b67cc-1e11-4bd9-bff9-fb834efb5b63" facs="#m-4b68ddd9-ce59-4f0b-9e44-3e5051da2baa" label="lyrics-like">tur in exhortándo, qui tribuit in</l><l xml:id="m-535b0db5-a465-426c-81b7-2108998ca8c0" facs="#m-9f7dc462-aab8-4590-96f5-82c25b200553" label="lyrics-like">cite persequéntibus vos: benedicite,</l><l xml:id="m-d22e3153-4c68-4a76-ae09-d2a19e469840" facs="#m-29231036-4589-4c1b-b2e5-33662bc58109" label="lyrics-like">simplicitáte, qui praeest in sollicitú¬</l><l xml:id="m-1c5f3c78-1215-48e6-8288-f41c9bfd7152" facs="#m-54bf886d-7d10-49d6-a056-f24337b0b336" label="lyrics-like">et nolite maledicere. Gaudére cum</l><l xml:id="m-4b5d8e1f-540d-49fd-9860-d1399204cc22" facs="#m-3ab5e579-9b03-46e8-bd93-abadbdbaf5db" label="lyrics-like">dine, qui miserétur in hilaritáte.</l><l xml:id="m-5800fa1a-d926-4b54-a896-0a87be46b466" facs="#m-0c718fae-bbdb-45e3-9e8e-f7258c4b4da0" label="lyrics-like">gaudéntibus, flere cum fléntibus:</l><l xml:id="m-d5acbc49-4686-4f41-9f86-c8f209389d21" facs="#m-d70979cc-fb19-4380-9a2a-9a2fb9e68484" label="lyrics-like">Diléctiõ sine simulatióne. Odiéntes</l><l xml:id="m-5af16111-f48e-4801-b873-70c00c48eacd" facs="#m-b864a93f-7c99-4c38-8fe1-3e7b25275c5d" label="lyrics-like">Idípsum invicem sentiéntes: Non</l><l xml:id="m-15a1085e-ba7c-4aea-bf85-b7bd1dc23556" facs="#m-e294d6e5-f4f6-4bcf-ba9e-09d20eafffc4" label="lyrics-like">malum, adhaeréntes bono: Caritáte</l><l xml:id="m-4caf40f0-8cb0-49ac-a43c-0594451a96b8" facs="#m-65f66f5c-e629-447b-8bf3-54e0916f1d46" label="lyrics-like">alta sapiéntes, sed humilibus con¬</l><l xml:id="m-7a8a0feb-4127-4b66-a1bc-87412e15eda4" facs="#m-73350156-16bd-434c-9b87-7b5e223aa4d2" label="lyrics-like">fraternitátis invicem diligéntes:</l><l xml:id="m-fa542bb0-6a3a-41e6-9eaf-7f0bb717baa3" facs="#m-21b1d575-0b20-4f1c-a8eb-feb0c6ae1198" label="lyrics-like">sentiéntes.</l><l xml:id="m-34d340c6-b26a-41e8-9e3a-542487fcbd68" facs="#m-087da594-8b9a-465e-82dd-22cf44348209" label="lyrics-like">Honóre invicem praeveniéntes:</l><l xml:id="m-a4b55719-8e8c-44b3-a3f0-29b3a0cb5765" facs="#m-f840dd41-95a6-46ed-9a9e-d288ce9d94c0" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-6150555c-5c57-4b07-a1c1-7c1cf29edc1f" facs="#m-509ba6e2-cc6c-4013-8d39-137884eef5fa" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-1c06fad1-06b7-45ef-abd1-d21ceb5a256c" facs="#m-84b8fcac-e515-4e6c-982d-be0b0beaa0e9" label="lyrics-like">LsDé</l><l xml:id="m-6ccce6d5-27c2-4d0f-ba77-dff865c62970" facs="#m-5cc8431d-4f3e-4a33-a4a5-60dfaff3ddab" label="lyrics-like">minus “ vér¬</l><l xml:id="m-790f8623-05f8-47e2-bfd9-35acd4914ccb" facs="#m-f1689495-13ab-4fba-b6bc-259fe99255db" label="lyrics-like">bum sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-dcaa4dc0-0da2-4fef-b7f8-0737cc2f9827" facs="#m-679ecd11-9092-402a-8989-6ffcef4d92a0" label="lyrics-like">um, et saná-vit</l><l xml:id="m-4179a3e0-dc16-4289-aaa4-11aaddde6382" facs="#m-50b1e77c-fce6-4654-a5bb-dc8672358642" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-09c9c985-a8d8-444a-abf2-bce6f4b587cc" facs="#m-3a315ff6-f7da-44f0-8f6d-f121ef72b643" label="lyrics-like">os: et e-rípu-it</l><l xml:id="m-cf1d52bb-0449-48f4-a623-3dee5459e43c" facs="#m-b7ef7a96-0aeb-4c98-af5f-3980baf9df67" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-2f18140f-371b-43df-a13b-db88aaafb8f3" facs="#m-3ef72fbd-03d9-443b-8542-d199383a415e" label="lyrics-like">os de intér-i-tu e-ó- rum.</l><l xml:id="m-65b9215d-3ddd-4aee-8b6c-b80ae15edb60" facs="#m-74f3533c-bc0b-4912-8e0a-e31495304af7" label="lyrics-like">V. Confi-te-án¬</l><l xml:id="m-b8685ea4-4c17-4944-8446-7b106d8151cd" facs="#m-5dedbb3e-8c29-4e20-af38-4cefc625dbb4" label="lyrics-like">tur Dómino</l><l xml:id="m-973cddf5-88a2-4103-b4be-49a4406fd508" facs="#m-7f48f559-d54d-45bf-aa70-275907691831" label="lyrics-like">mi-se-ri-córdi-ae</l><l xml:id="m-eca2e230-5eba-49b8-9d07-f10fb7834fc0" facs="#m-acccdb13-f0eb-47e1-a616-a9697f6c7b30" label="lyrics-like">et mi- ra-bí-li¬a</l><l xml:id="m-65a819df-6783-4c85-8bbe-f8ec2e4f5fc9" facs="#m-ec5624b1-b3b4-4b9c-967d-cfedf8384711" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-a31c37e5-8080-46f9-8f1e-8672b3949ba4" facs="#m-96ee7665-7e36-4dab-9456-16f166f049e3" label="ambiguous">jus:</l></lg>
